WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Forward heavy punch catches standing Manon as a Punish Counter.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.600
Standing medium punch links after the punish.

3
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:02.450
The back-heavy target follow-up connects after standing medium.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.650
Guile activates the heavy-punch Sonic Hurricane launcher.

5
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.800
Sonic Hurricane keeps Manon airborne.

6
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.850
OD Somersault Kick catches the Hurricane juggle.

7
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:06.200
Manon falls away after the OD kick.
